cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
message: "If you reference this hardware architecture, shared-aperture return-loss bridge, electromagnetic solver suite, or embedded firmware in academic or industrial work, please cite it as below."
title: "868 MHz LoRaWAN ISAC Surface-Permittivity Sensor Node (Rev E.5)"
abstract: "Open-hardware Integrated Sensing and Communications (ISAC) sensor node operating in the European 863-870 MHz (EU868) band. Shares a single Inverted-F + Interdigital Evanescent-Field Antenna (AE1) and RAK3172LP-SiP (STM32WLE5JC + SX1262) across a low-loss (-0.80 dB) asymmetric return-loss bridge and LT5538 logarithmic detector for 3-tone dielectric reflectometry and Class A LoRaWAN telemetry."
version: "E.5"
date-released: "2026-11-08"
license: "Apache-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/abbottsteve/LoRaWAN-ISAC-868MHz"
url: "https://github.com/abbottsteve/LoRaWAN-ISAC-868MHz"
